sendTo.description:
Audience selector. The booster targets recipients of the parent who
did NOT perform the implied action (`nonOpeners` did not open;
`nonClickers` did not click).

abTest.description:
A/B test configuration. Populated only when `type` is `abTest`;
variants carry their own content (see `ABTest.variants`), so the
top-level `content` field is omitted in that case.
